"{    \"translations\": [        {            \"english_version\": \"Police are looking for a man named Abdul B after a car was driven into a crowd and several people were stabbed. This happened at a Pride event in the German capital on Saturday night. The police are actively searching for the suspect.\",            \"english_title\": \"Police Search for Abdul B\",            \"translated_version\": \"La polic\u00eda busca a un hombre llamado Abdul B despu\u00e9s de que un coche choc\u00f3 contra una multitud y varias personas fueron apu\u00f1aladas. Esto pas\u00f3 en un evento de Orgullo en la capital de Alemania el s\u00e1bado por la noche. La polic\u00eda est\u00e1 buscando al sospechoso.\",            \"translated_title\": \"Polic\u00eda busca a Abdul B\"        },        {            \"english_version\": \"More than 340,000 people have been evacuated from wildfires in France and Spain. The fires have caused a lot of damage and people are being moved to safer areas.\",            \"english_title\": \"Evacuations Due to Wildfires\",            \"translated_version\": \"M\u00e1s de 340,000 personas han sido evacuadas por incendios en Francia y Espa\u00f1a. Los incendios han causado mucho da\u00f1o y la gente est\u00e1 siendo llevada a lugares m\u00e1s seguros.\",            \"translated_title\": \"Evacuaciones por incendios\"        },        {            \"english_version\": \"The latest attacks happened two days after a fight between settlers and Palestinians near the village of Tell. This fight resulted in the deaths of four Palestinians and two Israelis.\",            \"english_title\": \"Recent Attacks Near Tell\",            \"translated_version\": \"Los \u00faltimos ataques ocurrieron dos d\u00edas despu\u00e9s de una pelea entre colonos y palestinos cerca del pueblo de Tell. Esta pelea result\u00f3 en la muerte de cuatro palestinos y dos israel\u00edes.\",            \"translated_title\": \"Ataques cerca de Tell\"        },        {            \"english_version\": \"The US military says it stopped a tanker that was trying to get around the American blockade on Iranian ports. This is part of ongoing tensions between the US and Iran.\",            \"english_title\": \"US Stops Iranian Tanker\",            \"translated_version\": \"El ej\u00e9rcito de EE.UU. dice que detuvo un barco que intentaba evitar el bloqueo americano en puertos iran\u00edes. Esto es parte de las tensiones entre EE.UU. e Ir\u00e1n.\",            \"translated_title\": \"EE.UU. detiene barco iran\u00ed\"        },        {            \"english_version\": \"Karim Khan denies claims of having an improper sexual relationship with a junior ICC staff member. He is also accused of trying to stop her from making a complaint.\",            \"english_title\": \"Karim Khan Denies Allegations\",            \"translated_version\": \"Karim Khan niega las acusaciones de tener una relaci\u00f3n sexual inapropiada con una empleada joven de la ICC. Tambi\u00e9n se le acusa de intentar detenerla de hacer una queja.\",            \"translated_title\": \"Karim Khan niega acusaciones\"        }    ]}"